{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Adapt, and Survive.</strong>\u00a0<i>BIORAGE\u00a0</i>is an intense <strong>story-driven corridor FPS</strong> set in a fractured timeline where the force &quot;Freedom for All Rebellion&quot; clashes against the corporate empire &quot;Tempus Industries&quot;. Experience <strong>15  levels across 5 visually stunning chapters</strong>. After the main character gets trapped by Tempus in a failed mission, you're left isolated\u2014stranded between worlds seemingly colliding at your feet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Main Story is about 1 hour long!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Battle through <strong>15 handcrafted levels</strong> with immersive storytelling and explosive action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warfare</strong> \u2013 You have plenty of guns, enemies and environments to challenge you alongside a soundtrack that will keep you going and make you feel awesome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Every previous version is\u00a0accessible through Steam. For access, go to game page in library, gear icon, properties, and then game versions&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with: First Person Shooter Creator - Black Ice Mod Advanced\u00a0v3.4 beta 130125</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602390?t=1772132439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602390/6de7da6c030e90cecaaa0398a57c57924aceacf0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772132439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602390/10bf388659ba34decdc94bfc7be680b300b444d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772132439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets